loose and questionable semantics that may overlap other tags, but that is what
it was put int he language to mean.  "ca" seemed too specific.  I can imagine
someone writing a letter from Barcelona after the Olympics, say an article
for the newspaper, which is reporting on the Olympics.  Though the letter
is not "ca" the olympics, it is "fau" the Olympics.

